s: being_around_player
#
c: HasWeaponEquippedWithName('flamer')
#
t: Holy Firestorm, Batman!
t: You're not going to use that thing, are you?
t: Whoa, whoa, whoa! What are you doing with that thing?
t: I am sure you have a good reason to carry that around.

s: being_around_player
#
c: !HasArmorEquipped()
#
t: Put some clothes on, will you?
t: No pants, no service.
t: No clothes, no ride.

s: being_around_player
#
c: HasFlag('Killed(logan_faust)')
#
t: Drove a catering crew out to that mansion once. Nobody's ordering catering anymore, I hear.
t: You went past the wall and came back alone. I don't ask. I just notice.

s: being_around_player
#
c: HasFlag('ebi_strike_landed') && !HasFlag('Killed(logan_faust)')
#
t: EBI's been asking every driver about fares past the south gate. Out there it's double rate now, no offense.
t: Rotors over the old highway all night. I'm not driving out there for less than double.

s: being_around_player
#
c: HasFlag('Killed(gate_captain)')
#
t: South gate lost its captain. The watch is checking every cab twice now.
t: Heard the gate captain got shot. Heard it was somebody with your walk.

s: being_around_player
#
c: HasFlag('Killed(jacob_thorne)')
#
t: Used to drive Jacob Thorne home drunk twice a week. Fare's gone now.
t: East side's gotten rough since Thorne died. His boys don't get paid, so they take.

s: being_around_player
#
t: So, you are new in town?
t: I've been driving for a while now.
t: I've seen a lot of things.

s: being_damaged
#
t: Damn, that was close.
t: That hurt.
t: I'm not sure I can take another hit like that.
t: I'm sure I can take another hit like that.
t: You bastard!

s: kill_one_liner
#
t: Another one bites the dust.
t: You're in for a rough ride.

s: way_to_kill
#
t: Gotta ride.
t: As fast as I can.
